## Common Questions

**What do I get when I buy something here?**
Print-on-demand merchandise shipped to you, or digital downloads delivered by email immediately after
checkout. Checkout is a normal card payment.

**Are the action figures real? Can I buy the toys?**
No. No physical figure exists or ships. The 1994 toy line is fictional. What is sold is printed merchandise
and digital downloads.

**Where are the collectible one-of-one pieces?**
Collectible one-of-one pieces are released on OpenSea.

**How many characters are there?**
Six. That is the full cast.

**Where does merchandise ship from and how long does it take?**
Merchandise is made to order. See the shipping policy linked below for current times and destinations.

